# examples/ui/12_font, played: the title, the options and the credits, every
# word in Hack Bold -- with the keyboard and the gamepad, each screen a scene
# of its own, and the font kept from one to the next. See
# tests/e2e/script.h for the grammar.

# The title: the font is set in its _ready(), before its first frame.
12 shot title
12 expect scene TitleScene

# Down to Options, Enter: OptionsScene from the next frame.
13 tap KEY_DOWN
15 tap KEY_ENTER
17 expect scene OptionsScene

# Every control there in the font: hints off, the text a step faster, and
# the dropdown opened and walked to Wide awake.
18 tap KEY_ENTER
20 tap KEY_DOWN
22 tap KEY_RIGHT
24 tap KEY_DOWN
26 tap KEY_ENTER
28 tap KEY_DOWN
30 tap KEY_ENTER
42 shot options

# Escape is "ui_cancel": back to the title, and the options kept.
43 tap KEY_ESCAPE
45 expect scene TitleScene

# Down twice to Credits.
46 tap KEY_DOWN
48 tap KEY_DOWN
50 tap KEY_ENTER
52 expect scene CreditsScene
63 shot credits

# The gamepad's B is "ui_cancel" too.
64 tap GAMEPAD_BUTTON_RIGHT_FACE_RIGHT
66 expect scene TitleScene

# New game says, at the bottom, that there is none yet.
67 tap KEY_ENTER
80 shot no_game_yet
80 end
